<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.2">
<l>paṟavaiyēṟu parampuruṭā nīyeṉṉaik kaikkoṇṭapiṉ</l>
<l>piṟaviyeṉṉuṅ kaṭalumvaṟṟip perumpata mākiṉṟatāl</l>
<l>iṟavuceyyum pāvaṅkāṭu tīkkoḷī ivēkiṉṟatāl</l>
<l>aṟivaiyeṉṉu mamutavāṟu talaipaṟ ṟivāykkoṇṭatē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Supreme God who rides the bird,</l>
<l rend="indent">after you took me by hand</l>
<l>great bliss has dried up the sea called birth.</l>
<l>The forest of sin that causes death</l> 
<l rend="indent">has been seized by fire and burned.</l>
<l>The river of nectar called knowledge</l> 
<l rend="indent">grasped my head and took my lips.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
